{
  "sn4.24:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 4.24 ",
  "sn4.24:0.2": "3. Tatiyavagga ",
  "sn4.24:0.3": "Sattavassānubandhasutta ",
  "sn4.24:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "sn4.24:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā uruvelāyaṁ viharati najjā nerañjarāya tīre ajapālanigrodhe. ",
  "sn4.24:1.3": "Tena kho pana samayena māro pāpimā sattavassāni bhagavantaṁ anubandho hoti otārāpekkho otāraṁ alabhamāno. ",
  "sn4.24:1.4": "Atha kho māro pāpimā yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṁ gāthāya ajjhabhāsi: ",
  "sn4.24:2.1": "“Sokāvatiṇṇo nu vanamhi jhāyasi, ",
  "sn4.24:2.2": "Vittaṁ nu jīno uda patthayāno; ",
  "sn4.24:2.3": "Āguṁ nu gāmasmimakāsi kiñci, ",
  "sn4.24:2.4": "Kasmā janena na karosi sakkhiṁ; ",
  "sn4.24:2.5": "Sakkhī na sampajjati kenaci te”ti. ",
  "sn4.24:3.1": "“Sokassa mūlaṁ palikhāya sabbaṁ, ",
  "sn4.24:3.2": "Anāgu jhāyāmi asocamāno; ",
  "sn4.24:3.3": "Chetvāna sabbaṁ bhavalobhajappaṁ, ",
  "sn4.24:3.4": "Anāsavo jhāyāmi pamattabandhū”ti. ",
  "sn4.24:4.1": "“Yaṁ vadanti mama yidanti, ",
  "sn4.24:4.2": "ye vadanti mamanti ca; ",
  "sn4.24:4.3": "Ettha ce te mano atthi, ",
  "sn4.24:4.4": "na me samaṇa mokkhasī”ti. ",
  "sn4.24:5.1": "“Yaṁ vadanti na taṁ mayhaṁ, ",
  "sn4.24:5.2": "ye vadanti na te ahaṁ; ",
  "sn4.24:5.3": "Evaṁ pāpima jānāhi, ",
  "sn4.24:5.4": "na me maggampi dakkhasī”ti. ",
  "sn4.24:6.1": "“Sace maggaṁ anubuddhaṁ, ",
  "sn4.24:6.2": "khemaṁ amatagāmina�